{
    "name": "dockports",
    "display_name": "DockPorts",
    "description": "DockPorts 是一款现代化的 Docker 容器端口监控和可视化工具，帮助你轻松查看 NAS 或服务器上的端口占用情况，支持端口备注、隐藏与批量管理。",
    "category": "docker",
    "tags": [
        "docker",
        "端口管理",
        "端口占用",
        "可视化",
        "开源"
    ],
    "website": "https://github.com/coracoo/DockPorts",
    "source_url": "https://github.com/coracoo/DockPorts",
    "architectures": [
        "amd64",
        "arm64"
    ],
    "image": "ghcr.io/coracoo/dockports",
    "default_ports": [
        {
            "port": 7577,
            "protocol": "tcp",
            "description": "Web 管理界面"
        }
    ],
    "config_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
            "ports",
            "volumes",
            "dockports_env"
        ],
        "containers": [
            {
                "name": "dockports",
                "title": "DockPorts",
                "settings": [
                    {
                        "type": "ports",
                        "title": "端口设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "ports"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "volumes",
                        "title": "存储空间设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "volumes"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "env",
                        "title": "环境变量",
                        "fields": [
                            "dockports_env"
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "advanced",
                        "title": "高级设置",
                        "fields": [
                            "privileged"
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "description": "DockPorts 容器端口监控与可视化工具"
            }
        ],
        "properties": {
            "ports": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "local_port",
                        "container_port",
                        "protocol"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "protocol": {
                            "enum": [
                                "tcp",
                                "udp"
                            ],
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "协议",
                            "default": "tcp"
                        },
                        "local_port": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "title": "本地端口",
                            "maximum": 65535,
                            "minimum": 1
                        },
                        "container_port": {
                            "type": "integer",
                            "title": "容器端口",
                            "maximum": 65535,
                            "minimum": 1
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "端口设置",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "protocol": "tcp",
                        "local_port": 7577,
                        "container_port": 7577
                    }
                ]
            },
            "volumes": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "host_path",
                        "container_path",
                        "mode"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "mode": {
                            "enum": [
                                "rw",
                                "ro"
                            ],
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "权限",
                            "default": "rw"
                        },
                        "host_path": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "本地路径",
                            "format": "directory"
                        },
                        "container_path": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "容器路径"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "存储空间设置",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "mode": "ro",
                        "host_path": "/var/run/docker.sock",
                        "container_path": "/var/run/docker.sock"
                    },
                    {
                        "mode": "rw",
                        "host_path": "dockports/config",
                        "container_path": "/app/config"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "privileged": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "title": "特权模式",
                "default": false,
                "description": "一般无需开启"
            },
            "dockports_env": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                        "key",
                        "value"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                        "key": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "变量名"
                        },
                        "value": {
                            "type": "string",
                            "title": "值"
                        }
                    }
                },
                "title": "环境变量",
                "default": [
                    {
                        "key": "TZ",
                        "value": "Asia/Shanghai"
                    },
                    {
                        "key": "DOCKPORTS_PORT",
                        "value": "7577"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    },
    "yaml_template": "services:\n  dockports:\n    image: {{ image }}\n    container_name: {{ project_name }}\n    ports:\n{%- for port in ports %}\n      - \"{{ port.local_port }}:{{ port.container_port }}/{{ port.protocol }}\"\n{%- endfor %}\n    volumes:\n{%- for vol in volumes %}\n      - {{ to_host_path(vol.host_path if (vol.host_path.startswith('/') or vol.shared) else project_name ~ '/' ~ vol.host_path) }}:{{ vol.container_path }}:{{ vol.mode }}\n{%- endfor %}\n    privileged: {{ privileged | lower }}\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n{%- for item in dockports_env %}\n      - {{ item.key }}={{ item.value }}\n{%- endfor %}\n",
    "readme": "# DockPorts\n\nDockPorts 是一款现代化的 Docker 容器端口监控和可视化工具，通过 Docker API 实时获取容器端口映射，并结合 netstat 展示宿主机端口占用情况，支持 TCP/UDP 过滤、端口备注、隐藏与批量管理。\n\n## 部署前准备\n\n1. 「存储空间设置」中已默认以只读方式挂载 `/var/run/docker.sock`（必需），以及配置目录 `/app/config`（保存端口备注等数据）。\n2. 容器内默认监听 `7577` 端口，如需修改请同步调整「端口设置」和环境变量 `DOCKPORTS_PORT`。\n\n## 使用\n\n1. 部署完成后访问 `http://<NAS-IP>:7577`。\n2. 页面以卡片形式展示全部端口：蓝色为已使用端口（标注容器名或系统来源），灰色为可用端口区间。\n3. 可为端口添加备注，或将不关心的端口隐藏到「已隐藏」标签页。\n\n## 说明\n\n官方镜像托管在 GitHub Container Registry（ghcr.io/coracoo/dockports）；国内拉取困难时可改用作者提供的阿里云镜像地址（见项目 README）。",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "type": "compose",
    "changelog": "初始导入",
    "backup_paths": [
        "/app/config"
    ],
    "is_builtin": false
}
